WEBVTT

1
00:00:58.666 --> 00:01:03.083
In verses 15.16 to 15.18 of Chapter 15,

2
00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:07.500
Lord Krishna now summarises
the essence of Vedanta.

3
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.500
In the previous verse, 15.15,

4
00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.583
Lord Krishna revealed Himself as the source

5
00:01:11.583 --> 00:01:14.625
of memory, knowledge, and forgetfulness.

6
00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:16.875
He revealed Himself as the source of the Vedas,

7
00:01:16.875 --> 00:01:20.166
their knower, and their ultimate goal.

8
00:01:20.166 --> 00:01:23.208
Now in these three verses He explains –

9
00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:26.708
who we are, who He is, and how He is

10
00:01:26.708 --> 00:01:28.583
beyond both material

11
00:01:28.583 --> 00:01:30.958
and spiritual designations.

12
00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:34.500
This is why this group of three verses

13
00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:37.291
is also called the Tri-Shloki Gita.

14
00:01:42.208 --> 00:01:43.208
Lord Krishna here

15
00:01:43.208 --> 00:01:44.791
divides jivatmas

16
00:01:44.791 --> 00:01:48.041
into two categories.

17
00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:51.875
The first category is the kshara souls.

18
00:01:51.875 --> 00:01:53.500
These are the beings

19
00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:56.833
who are affected by body and matter,

20
00:01:56.833 --> 00:01:59.958
and bound by the cycle of birth and death.

21
00:01:59.958 --> 00:02:03.208
They take on bodies, grow old,

22
00:02:03.208 --> 00:02:05.000
face death,

23
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.458
and then enter new bodies.

24
00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:11.708
The second category is the akshara souls.

25
00:02:11.708 --> 00:02:14.666
These are the beings who have
attained liberation

26
00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:18.041
and reached the spiritual realm, and are now

27
00:02:18.041 --> 00:02:21.166
untouched by material change.

28
00:02:21.166 --> 00:02:24.833
But Lord Krishna also makes clear here

29
00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:25.916
that reality

30
00:02:25.916 --> 00:02:28.916
is not limited to just these two categories.

31
00:02:28.916 --> 00:02:32.708
Beyond both of them there is someone else.

32
00:02:32.708 --> 00:02:35.916
In verse 15.17

33
00:02:35.916 --> 00:02:39.541
He introduces this third entity –

34
00:02:39.541 --> 00:02:44.083
the Purushottama, the Supreme Person.

35
00:02:44.083 --> 00:02:47.208
This is no ordinary being who
has become supreme

36
00:02:47.208 --> 00:02:48.791
through practice.

37
00:02:48.791 --> 00:02:51.375
He is entirely distinct –

38
00:02:51.375 --> 00:02:56.000
immutable, the controller, and the sustainer.

39
00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.458
He is also called the imperishable,

40
00:02:57.458 --> 00:03:00.375
the Lord, and the nourisher.

41
00:03:00.375 --> 00:03:02.791
He pervades all three worlds

42
00:03:02.791 --> 00:03:04.958
and sustains everything.

43
00:03:04.958 --> 00:03:06.500
This is the Paramatma –

44
00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:10.708
the Lord seated within every being.

45
00:03:10.708 --> 00:03:11.666
Lord Krishna here

46
00:03:11.666 --> 00:03:13.208
refers to Himself

47
00:03:13.208 --> 00:03:15.416
as ‘another Purusha’ –

48
00:03:15.416 --> 00:03:17.333
as if presenting a subtle

49
00:03:17.333 --> 00:03:19.666
principle of Vedanta.

50
00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:21.166
But in the very next moment

51
00:03:21.166 --> 00:03:22.666
He lifts the veil

52
00:03:22.666 --> 00:03:25.333
and reveals Himself –

53
00:03:25.333 --> 00:03:28.416
‘I am that Purushottama, who is beyond

54
00:03:28.416 --> 00:03:30.791
both kshara and akshara.

55
00:03:30.791 --> 00:03:33.208
This is why I am celebrated

56
00:03:33.208 --> 00:03:37.041
in the world and in the Vedas
as the Supreme Person.’

57
00:03:37.041 --> 00:03:40.041
Thus in these three verses,

58
00:03:40.041 --> 00:03:43.250
Lord Krishna draws a profound conclusion –

59
00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:46.166
He is not merely a part of this world.

60
00:03:46.166 --> 00:03:48.041
He is its origin,

61
00:03:48.041 --> 00:03:49.666
its sustainer,

62
00:03:49.666 --> 00:03:52.416
and its ultimate goal.

63
00:03:52.416 --> 00:03:54.625
He is beyond material reality,

64
00:03:54.625 --> 00:03:58.416
which binds us, and beyond spiritual reality,

65
00:03:58.416 --> 00:04:00.916
which frees us.

66
00:04:00.916 --> 00:04:01.708
Yet

67
00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:02.708
He enters

68
00:04:02.708 --> 00:04:04.166
our lives and hearts

69
00:04:04.166 --> 00:04:05.666
with love,

70
00:04:05.666 --> 00:04:08.083
to draw us out of delusion

71
00:04:08.083 --> 00:04:10.458
and lead us toward truth.

72
00:04:10.458 --> 00:04:11.458
This also

73
00:04:11.458 --> 00:04:13.958
refutes the idea

74
00:04:13.958 --> 00:04:17.000
that the soul ultimately merges into God

75
00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.333
and becomes God.

76
00:04:20.333 --> 00:04:21.750
No – even the liberated

77
00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:25.708
soul does not become Lord Krishna.

78
00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:28.375
Krishna remains Krishna always.

79
00:04:28.375 --> 00:04:32.458
Liberation does not mean losing
personal identity,

80
00:04:32.458 --> 00:04:34.375
but living in loving harmony

81
00:04:34.375 --> 00:04:37.708
with the Lord.

82
00:04:37.708 --> 00:04:39.000
By establishing Himself

83
00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.791
as Purushottama,

84
00:04:40.791 --> 00:04:43.875
Lord Krishna reveals this simple truth –

85
00:04:43.875 --> 00:04:46.875
our purpose is not to become God.

86
00:04:46.875 --> 00:04:48.166
Our purpose

87
00:04:48.166 --> 00:04:51.291
is to serve Him with love.

88
00:04:51.291 --> 00:04:53.958
This is the final goal of all scriptures,

89
00:04:53.958 --> 00:04:56.750
practices, and paths.

90
00:05:01.083 --> 00:05:05.291
Making mistakes in life is natural.

91
00:05:05.291 --> 00:05:08.541
You are kshara –

92
00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:12.458
changeable, learning from experience.

93
00:05:12.458 --> 00:05:16.083
I have never expected perfection

94
00:05:16.083 --> 00:05:18.208
from you.

95
00:05:18.208 --> 00:05:21.041
I have only said this –

96
00:05:21.041 --> 00:05:24.166
if you fall, do not stop there.

97
00:05:24.166 --> 00:05:27.000
If you stray from the path,

98
00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.625
do not try to justify it.

99
00:05:30.625 --> 00:05:33.916
Rise – and move toward Me.

100
00:05:33.916 --> 00:05:38.208
I have said – beyond both kshara and akshara,

101
00:05:38.208 --> 00:05:42.083
the Purushottama.

102
00:05:42.083 --> 00:05:44.541
I am that.

103
00:05:44.541 --> 00:05:47.375
You may be weak,

104
00:05:47.375 --> 00:05:49.791
but you are not helpless.

105
00:05:49.791 --> 00:05:53.208
You may feel lonely,

106
00:05:53.208 --> 00:05:58.041
but you are never truly alone.

107
00:05:58.041 --> 00:06:03.416
I am closer to you than your own breath –

108
00:06:03.416 --> 00:06:06.833
simply waiting

109
00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:11.416
for you to trust Me.

110
00:06:11.416 --> 00:06:17.208
When you, without shame,
accept your weakness

111
00:06:17.208 --> 00:06:20.625
and turn toward Me with a sincere heart,

112
00:06:20.625 --> 00:06:24.000
you touch a strength

113
00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:26.958
that is beyond this world.

114
00:06:26.958 --> 00:06:31.125
Mistakes are part of the journey,

115
00:06:31.125 --> 00:06:36.958
but getting stuck in them is not your destiny.

116
00:06:36.958 --> 00:06:39.833
Fear only this –

117
00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:43.291
that you forget

118
00:06:43.291 --> 00:06:47.541
that you are rising through His love, guidance,

119
00:06:47.541 --> 00:06:50.458
and support –

120
00:06:50.458 --> 00:06:53.250
the one who never falls.

121
00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.958
Move forward remembering Me

122
00:06:55.958 --> 00:07:00.125
and the support I give.

123
00:07:00.125 --> 00:07:01.958
Stay grateful.

124
00:07:01.958 --> 00:07:04.541
Then you will surely

125
00:07:04.541 --> 00:07:06.916
come toward Me.

126
00:07:11.541 --> 00:07:13.083
In families,

127
00:07:13.083 --> 00:07:17.791
it is natural to see each other’s mistakes –

128
00:07:17.791 --> 00:07:20.750
sometimes wrong words are said,

129
00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.458
sometimes wrong decisions are made.

130
00:07:23.458 --> 00:07:26.375
This is natural, because

131
00:07:26.375 --> 00:07:30.750
every member of the home is kshara –

132
00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:34.666
fallible, and learning from experience.

133
00:07:34.666 --> 00:07:38.500
But do not stop there.

134
00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.375
I have said – beyond kshara

135
00:07:41.375 --> 00:07:47.750
and akshara, I am the Purushottama,

136
00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:52.791
and every soul is always connected to Me.

137
00:07:52.791 --> 00:07:58.375
If you only keep looking at
each other’s mistakes,

138
00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:00.500
the mind will become hard

139
00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.625
and critical.

140
00:08:03.625 --> 00:08:07.833
But if you see only their spiritual

141
00:08:07.833 --> 00:08:11.958
potential, sometimes their immediate

142
00:08:11.958 --> 00:08:14.708
practical needs

143
00:08:14.708 --> 00:08:16.666
may go unnoticed.

144
00:08:16.666 --> 00:08:21.875
True love is a balance of both –

145
00:08:21.875 --> 00:08:26.291
seeing where they may stumble,

146
00:08:26.291 --> 00:08:32.000
and also seeing where they can succeed.

147
00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.250
Guide your children,

148
00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:37.666
parents, and partner –

149
00:08:37.666 --> 00:08:41.333
but with compassion and gentleness,

150
00:08:41.333 --> 00:08:43.458
not with criticism.

151
00:08:43.458 --> 00:08:45.541
Remind them

152
00:08:45.541 --> 00:08:49.208
that even after their greatest mistakes,

153
00:08:49.208 --> 00:08:51.500
their worth remains.

154
00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:58.041
Awaken them to their spiritual potential.

155
00:08:58.041 --> 00:09:02.791
A family does not grow through
the expectation of perfection.

156
00:09:02.791 --> 00:09:06.458
A family grows when every member,

157
00:09:06.458 --> 00:09:09.375
with patience and trust,

158
00:09:09.375 --> 00:09:11.500
nurtures the divine possibility

159
00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:14.583
hidden within each other.

160
00:09:14.583 --> 00:09:18.000
And whenever this trust rests in Me,

161
00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:22.958
love in the home deepens naturally.

162
00:09:27.375 --> 00:09:30.583
In the spiritual realm, every soul

163
00:09:30.583 --> 00:09:33.541
maintains its own uniqueness,

164
00:09:33.541 --> 00:09:37.541
yet all move forward in one rhythm –

165
00:09:37.541 --> 00:09:39.708
because every heart

166
00:09:39.708 --> 00:09:42.666
is united in My love.

167
00:09:42.666 --> 00:09:44.375
I have said –

168
00:09:44.375 --> 00:09:48.000
beyond kshara and akshara, the Purushottama.

169
00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:51.583
I am the one who holds everything together.

170
00:09:51.583 --> 00:09:55.166
At your workplace too, always remember –

171
00:09:55.166 --> 00:09:57.541
true success does not come

172
00:09:57.541 --> 00:09:59.375
when everyone is forced

173
00:09:59.375 --> 00:10:01.750
to think the same way.

174
00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:04.750
Success comes when each person

175
00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:08.125
contributes according to their own strengths,

176
00:10:08.125 --> 00:10:09.583
and all move together

177
00:10:09.583 --> 00:10:12.625
toward a shared purpose.

178
00:10:12.625 --> 00:10:14.625
To build a good team,

179
00:10:14.625 --> 00:10:18.833
it is not necessary to erase
anyone’s personality –

180
00:10:18.833 --> 00:10:21.875
it is necessary to connect hearts.

181
00:10:21.875 --> 00:10:24.750
Honour differences,

182
00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:27.625
amplify others’ strengths,

183
00:10:27.625 --> 00:10:29.708
and remember –

184
00:10:29.708 --> 00:10:34.125
behind every skill there is a deeper connection,

185
00:10:34.125 --> 00:10:36.458
a mutual dependence

186
00:10:36.458 --> 00:10:39.500
for a higher purpose.

187
00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:43.875
When you lead with this vision,

188
00:10:43.875 --> 00:10:46.875
targets are not the only thing that gets fulfilled.

189
00:10:46.875 --> 00:10:50.958
You create an environment of trust,

190
00:10:50.958 --> 00:10:55.166
creativity, and lasting success.

191
00:10:55.166 --> 00:10:58.625
A true team is not built on uniformity,

192
00:10:58.625 --> 00:11:04.500
but on the unity that is born
from deep understanding.
